### Project ignores
tmp/

# Worktree-discipline pack — installed from the livespec-dev-tooling package
# (the single canonical source) into dev-tooling/ at bootstrap, NEVER tracked
# here, mirroring how the commit-refuse hooks are installed into the untracked
# shared .git/hooks/ dir. The pack is four files: the two executable shell
# scripts plus the `worktree.just` and `branch-protection.just` recipe
# fragments the root justfile `import?`s. `just bootstrap` materializes them
# via the `worktree-pack` LOCAL obligation row.
/dev-tooling/worktree-lib.sh
/dev-tooling/branch-protection.sh
/dev-tooling/worktree.just
/dev-tooling/branch-protection.just
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/worktrees/
.codex
.idea/

### Python toolchain artifacts
# Note: .mypy_cache/ is intentionally NOT listed. Mypy is not used
# (livespec-runtime pins pyright); its cache path is therefore
# not a tolerated artifact.
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
.coverage
.coverage.*
.ruff_cache/
.pyright/
.mutmut-cache/
mutants/
htmlcov/

